message: "If you use this work, please cite the conference paper below."
title: "An Intelligent Gearbox Fault Diagnosis under Different Operating Conditions using Adversarial Domain Adaptation"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid unsupervised domain-adaptation framework (DCAN, Deep Coral
  Adversarial Network) for gearbox fault diagnosis under changing operating
  conditions. A one-dimensional CNN extracts features from raw vibration
  signals, while two modules — deep CORAL and an adversarial domain
  discriminator — align a labeled source operating condition with an
  unlabeled target operating condition. Evaluated on the SEU gearbox dataset.
